type: image
style: comic book art / digital illustration
aspect: 16:9
resolution: 2048x1152

prompt: |
  A vibrant comic book splash page showing a robot superhero bursting through a wall of textbooks.
  Dynamic action pose — the robot is flying forward, cape billowing, books scattering.
  Speech bubble reads "KNOWLEDGE IS POWER!" in bold comic lettering.
  Background: classic comic halftone dot pattern in warm yellow (#ffcc00).
  Speed lines radiate outward from the robot. Small "POW" and "ZAP" starburst effects.
  The robot's eyes glow bright blue (#3366ff). Body is metallic with red (#ff3366) accents.
  Thick black outlines (3px). Flat color fills. No gradients — cel-shaded comic style.
  Panel border: thick black frame with slight rotation (2deg).
  Style: American superhero comic art, Silver Age influence. Bold, kinetic, maximum energy.

usage: Hero banner for the Comic theme — full-width background, text overlaid in speech bubbles.
